{"n": 929, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "929.webp", "text": "51-241\n\n5124341 REPLACING TORSION BARS\nFOR TRUNK LID\n\nDisengage torsion bart with Special Tool\n512 100\n\nDisengage torsion bars on trunk lid.\nInstallation\n\nPrevent trunk lid from falling down.\nTorsion bars only have limited preload.\n\ninstallation:\n\nCheck torsion bars for rubbing spots in case\nofa grinding noise.\n\nIf necessary, lubricate joints with grease and\nalign rubber mounts.\n\ninstallation:\n\nThe preload of torsion bars can be increased\nby inserting them in the second catch.\n\nThis could be necessary, for example, for the\nlarge toolbox.\n\n30 51 709\n\n5124... REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nOR REPLACING GAS PRESSURE\nPROPS\n\nLift out clips.\nRemove gas pressure props.\n\nfastaliatian:\n\nPrevent trunk lid from falling down,\nCompress gas pressure props slightly while\ninstalling.\n\nInstallation\n\nInstall piston rod facing down,\n\nProtect piston rod against dirt, paint and\ndamage.", "words": [["51-241", 0.4672, 0.0311, 0.5338, 0.0562], ["5124341", 0.2631, 0.0615, 0.3106, 0.072], ["REPLACING", 0.3263, 0.0615, 0.3889, 0.072], ["TORSION", 0.3929, 0.0615, 0.4419, 0.0734], ["BARS", 0.446, 0.0615, 0.4753, 0.0734], ["FOR", 0.3263, 0.0773, 0.3475, 0.0886], ["TRUNK", 0.3525, 0.0773, 0.3909, 0.0886], ["LID", 0.396, 0.0773, 0.4131, 0.0886], ["Disengage", 0.2631, 0.1097, 0.3106, 0.1229], ["torsion", 0.3141, 0.1124, 0.3475, 0.1203], ["bart", 0.3505, 0.111, 0.3697, 0.1203], ["with", 0.3727, 0.111, 0.3939, 0.1203], ["Special", 0.398, 0.1097, 0.4303, 0.1229], ["Tool", 0.4343, 0.1097, 0.4561, 0.1216], ["512", 0.2631, 0.1256, 0.2843, 0.1362], ["100", 0.2884, 0.1256, 0.3056, 0.1362], ["Disengage", 0.2631, 0.2981, 0.3106, 0.3113], ["torsion", 0.3141, 0.2981, 0.3475, 0.3087], ["bars", 0.3505, 0.2981, 0.3697, 0.3087], ["on", 0.3727, 0.3007, 0.3848, 0.3087], ["trunk", 0.3889, 0.2994, 0.4141, 0.3087], ["lid.", 0.4182, 0.2981, 0.4323, 0.3087], ["Installation", 0.2631, 0.3139, 0.3172, 0.3245], ["Prevent", 